<!doctype html>
<html lang="tr"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Paketler ve fiyatlar - <?= e($siteName) ?></title><link rel="stylesheet" href="<?= e(url('/assets/app.css')) ?>"></head>
<body><header class="site-header"><a href="<?= e(url('/')) ?>" class="brand"><?= e($siteName) ?></a><nav><?php foreach($headerMenus as $item): ?><a href="<?= e(menu_href($item['url'])) ?>" target="<?= e($item['target']) ?>" <?= $item['target']==='_blank'?'rel="noopener noreferrer"':'' ?>><?= e($item['label']) ?></a><?php endforeach; ?></nav></header>
<main class="container"><h1>Paketler ve fiyatlar</h1><div class="stats"><?php foreach($plans as $plan): ?><article class="site-card"><h2><?= e($plan['name']) ?></h2><p><?= e($plan['description']) ?></p><strong><?= e(number_format((float)$plan['price'],2,',','.')) ?> <?= e($plan['currency']) ?> / <?= $plan['billing_period']==='yearly'?'yıl':'ay' ?></strong><p>Günlük <?= (int)$plan['daily_visit_limit'] ?> ziyaret · <?= (int)$plan['website_limit'] ?> web sitesi</p><ul><?php foreach($plan['features'] as $feature): ?><li><?= e($feature) ?></li><?php endforeach; ?></ul><?php if(auth()): ?><a class="button" href="<?= e(url('/payments/checkout?plan='.(int)$plan['id'])) ?>">Paketi satın al</a><?php else: ?><a class="button" href="<?= e(url('/register')) ?>">Kayıt ol</a><?php endif; ?></article><?php endforeach; ?></div><p>Ödemeler PayTR veya iyzico güvenli ödeme ekranları üzerinden alınır. Otomatik yenileme, desteklenen iyzico abonelik planlarında müşteri onayıyla etkinleştirilir.</p></main></body></html>
